#### From the Explorer sidebar

¬TODO - add images etc

1. Click the **Explorer** icon in the left sidebar (or press `Ctrl+Shift+E` / `Cmd+Shift+E`).

2. Navigate through your folder tree to the file you want.

3. Click the file name. It opens in the editor pane to the right.

If the file is a `.tsmap`, `.tsvar`, or `.md` file, Docs Assembler will activate its syntax highlighting and IntelliSense automatically.


